		<title type="html"><![CDATA[choosing proper hull axes for SAT]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=2349#p2349"><![CDATA[
You have to use the face normals for both hulls and the edge-edge cross products, where the edge pairs are all the combinations of edges between the two hulls. No edge pairs are taken from a single hull.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=12">Erin Catto</a> — Mon Nov 06, 2006 5:03 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
